# CODEOWNERS — directory-level review ownership (Google's OWNERS model).
# Combined with branch protection (require review from Code Owners), nothing
# merges into an owned path without an owner's approval.
# Syntax: <path>  <@owner> [@owner2] [@team]
#
# Last match wins. Replace the placeholders with real users/teams.

# Default owner for everything:
*                       @your-org/maintainers

# Examples — narrow ownership for sensitive areas:
# /packages/eslint-plugin/   @your-org/platform
# /dal/                      @your-org/data
# /.github/                  @your-org/devops
# *.sql                      @your-org/data
